Fonts (src/gui/fonts/)
----------------------
lv_font_montserrat_14_uml.c, _16_uml.c, _20_uml.c, _28_uml.c are generated with
LVGL's font converter from Montserrat Medium, SIL Open Font License 1.1. The
license text is next to them: src/gui/fonts/OFL-Montserrat.txt. The generator
command is in the header of each file; it adds the Latin-1 range (0xA0-0xFF) to
the ASCII set of the upstream font.

Icon font (src/gui/fonts/lv_font_mdi_icons_20.c)
-----------------------------------------------
The two glyphs of the energy-flow diagram are `transmission-tower` (U+F0D3E,
grid node) and `solar-power` (U+F0A72, PV node) from **Material Design Icons
(Community)**, Apache License 2.0:

    https://github.com/pictogrammers/material-design-icons
    Copyright (c) 2021 Pictogrammers

Generated with lv_font_conv from the webfont of `@mdi/font` 7.4.47. Apache-2.0 is
already in this distribution through ESP-IDF and the ported RCT client, so no
new license enters the tree.

These replace two glyphs that had been taken from the icon font embedded in the
RCT Portal. Their code points, U+E039 and U+E044, do not match Google's
Material Icons at those positions — they were checked against the current
upstream font — so nothing about that font could be attributed and it has been
removed.

